     1107     assign
     1108       v-label-handle7 = date_from :side-label-handle in frame Dialog-Frame
     1109     .
     1110     if valid-handle (v-label-handle7)
     1111     then do:
     1112       if v-label-handle7 :tooltip = ""
     1113       or v-label-handle7 :tooltip = ?
     1114       then do:
